sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Front-end User
    participant Frontend
    actor Client
    participant SocketServer as Socket.IO Server
    participant Handler as SocketHandler
    participant Service
    participant Repo
    participant DB

    User->>Frontend: opens trip activity page
    Frontend->>Client: emit activity:join {trip_id, trip_date}
    Client->>SocketServer: emit activity:join {trip_id, trip_date}
    SocketServer->>Handler: ActivityJoin
    Handler->>Handler: set SocketContext, join room
    Handler->>Service: SocketActivityJoin(member_id, trip_id, trip_date)
    Service->>Repo: GetTripMemberRole
    Repo->>DB: SELECT role
    DB-->>Repo: role
    Service->>Repo: GetActivities(trip_id, trip_date)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT activities
    DB-->>Repo: activities
    Service-->>Handler: activities + isEditable
    Handler-->>SocketServer: emit activity:join response
    SocketServer-->>Client: activity:join response
    Client->>Frontend: activity:join response
    Frontend->>User: displays activities
